---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Zeus DeLaCruz — Builder, Operator, Architect" description="Sovereign infrastructure builder — AI agents, TAK, NATS fabric, robotics. Consulting, coaching, speaking, system building. Self-hosted. Yours forever.">
  <section class="hero-full">
    <div class="hero-badge">ZEUS DELACRUZ</div>
    <h1><span style="color:var(--white);">Builder.</span><br><span style="color:var(--accent-bright);">Operator.</span><br><span style="color:var(--white);">Architect.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub" style="max-width:620px;font-size:1.15rem;">I build sovereign infrastructure — AI agents, meshed networks, robotic systems, and the operating system that runs them all. Everything I build is self-hosted, open-source, and yours forever. No subscriptions. No walled gardens. No one else's cloud.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:2rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <span class="stat-chip">🧠 OneMind OS</span>
      <span class="stat-chip">⚡ 5 AI Agents</span>
      <span class="stat-chip">🗺️ TAK Server</span>
      <span class="stat-chip">📡 NATS Fabric</span>
      <span class="stat-chip">🤖 Robotics</span>
      <span class="stat-chip">🏠 Homestead Ops</span>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href="/resources/starter-kit/" class="btn-primary" style="font-size:1rem;">Get the Starter Kit →</a>
      <a href="/services/" class="btn-ghost" style="font-size:1rem;">Work With Me</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:3rem 0;">
    <h2 style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">What I Build</h2>
    <p style="text-align:center;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 2.5rem;">One stack. Four planes. Everything integrated. Nothing rented.</p>
    <div class="card-grid two-col">
      <div class="card">
        <h4>🧠 AI Agent Fabric</h4>
        <p>A sovereign multi-agent system — Legacy (550B), 4 specialized pillar agents, and an edge daughter. All living on the NATS message bus, all deployable from a single docker-compose. Your own AI country.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>🗺️ TAK Common Operating Picture</h4>
        <p>Military-grade situational awareness — maps, sensors, drones, cameras, team tracking. Self-hosted on your hardware. CloudTAK bridges it to the web. Every device sees the same picture.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>📡 NATS Nervous System</h4>
        <p>The message bus that connects everything — agents, sensors, robots, apps, phones, spreadsheets. Publish once, every subscriber gets it. JetStream for history. Leaf nodes for the edge.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h4>🤖 Robotics & Hardware</h4>
        <p>Sovereign Node — the on-prem appliance that runs the whole stack. Camera kits. Sensor meshes. Drone integration. All wired to the bus. All yours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);">
    <h2 style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">The 4 Pillars</h2>
    <p style="text-align:center;max-width:550px;margin:0 auto 2.5rem;">Everything I do maps to one of these four domains. The agents run them. The community is organized by them. The products serve them.</p>
    <div class="card-grid two-col">
      <div class="card" style="border-left:3px solid var(--accent-bright);">
        <h4>⚡ SO · Sovereign Operations</h4>
        <p>Tech, infrastructure, security, TAK, NATS — the operator's pillar. What runs the stack, protects the stack, extends the stack.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="border-left:3px solid var(--accent-bright);">
        <h4>💪 HP · Holistic Performance</h4>
        <p>Mind, body, finance, habits, relationships — the human operating system. Peak performance across all dimensions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="border-left:3px solid var(--accent-bright);">
        <h4>🏡 LE · Legacy Evolution</h4>
        <p>Home, family, land, estate, heritage — the roots. Smart home, greenhouses, family archives, community mesh.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="border-left:3px solid var(--accent-bright);">
        <h4>👑 GE · Generational Empire</h4>
        <p>Business, revenue, marketing, partnerships, product — the engine. CRM, funnels, courses, consulting, child companies.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:center;">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">The Stack Is Sovereign</h2>
    <p style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;">Every piece of the OneMind stack runs on hardware you own. Docker Compose. One command. No vendor lock-in. No monthly SaaS tax. The code is open. The configs are templates. You can fork it, extend it, or rip it apart and rebuild it your way.</p>
    <p style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;"><strong>The mission:</strong> $50K/month by month 9 — funded entirely by the community, courses, and consulting. No VC. No outside capital. Just builders paying builders for tools that make them more sovereign.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:2rem;">
      <a href="/resources/starter-kit/" class="btn-primary" style="font-size:1rem;">Get the Starter Kit — Free →</a>
      <p style="margin-top:0.75rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:#9ca3af;">10 commands. Full architecture diagram. docker-compose. NATS subject map. Yours in 30 seconds.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>